      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "EYES BEEN PATIENT (1) was unplaced two starts ago then things went wrong last start when he broke and finished 6 metres away in fourth over 2030m at this track. Will enjoy a nice run from this favourable starting position. Big chance if he behaves in this similar assignment. WILL I AM (7) finished third at Goulburn two runs ago then settled back and failed to figure at his latest appearance over 1609m at Menangle, beaten 17 metres into ninth. Interesting to see what unfolds from this wide draw. Meets a comparable field and he can bounce back straight away. SYLVIA KAY NZ (2) is heading the right way, improving last time out to finish second at this track over 1609m. Genuine threat. SPOOKY ART (3) has been coming from the back row of late so can do better from a more favourable draw.",
